            <title>[LU-20283] sanityn test_113: cannot find mgc</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20283</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for S Buisson &amp;lt;sbuisson@ddn.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/dc0edb7d-47a6-45d4-a4d4-662e63ac51da" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/dc0edb7d-47a6-45d4-a4d4-662e63ac51da&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_113 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;cannot find mgc of 10.240.22.13@tcp,172.16.10.14@tcp
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125309" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125309&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.117.1.el8_10.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125309" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/125309&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.117.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The MGS NIDs look suspicious: 10.240.22.13@tcp,172.16.10.14@tcp&lt;br/&gt;
10.240.22.13@tcp is presumably the correct one, on the Ethernet interface, but 172.16.10.14@tcp looks like the IPoIB address of the Infiniband interface, but that is incorrectly considered on the 'tcp' LNet network.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think patch "&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20173" title="sanity-sec test_31: unable to remount client (connection timed out)" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20173"&gt;LU-20173&lt;/a&gt; tests: filter on nettype when building nidlist" at &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/65970" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/65970&lt;/a&gt; is the fix for this issue.&lt;/p&gt;





&lt;p&gt;VVVVVVV DO NOT REMOVE LINES BELOW, Added by Maloo for auto-association VVVVVVV&lt;br/&gt;
sanityn test_113 - cannot find mgc of 10.240.22.13@tcp,172.16.10.14@tcp&lt;/p&gt;</description>
